@startuml command_http_flow
title Target-only Lightweight GET and Builtin JSON POST
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d84dd3d6 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeSessionController.java getSession.
' Architecture change: command routes use ResultBean JSON and no request SSE.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@6f52fddc modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/service/command/CompositeCommandRegistry.java resolve.
' Product decision: GET uses full sources and state-filtered name/kind/description/input; POST keeps locked admission.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d8e22562 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtime/AgentRuntimeManager.java prepareCached and toRuntime.
' Product decision: Help uses authored Agent metadata; it does not format the command catalog.
skinparam shadowing false
actor Caller
participant Controller
participant Application
participant Registry
participant Handler
participant "Narrow service" as Service
Caller -> Controller : GET commands\nor POST command
Controller -> Application : validated VO\nlocale + headers
alt GET shared catalog
  Application -> Registry : resolve all sources\ncomplete Agent cache
  Registry --> Application : immutable catalog or target 503
  Application --> Controller : filter state, order\nlightweight VO
else POST Builtin
  Application -> Registry : resolve once with BUILTIN filter
  Registry --> Application : immutable catalog
  Application -> Handler : selected definition\nsame catalog
  alt Help
    Handler -> Service : query Agent help\nusing Session agentId
    Service -> Service : prepareCached once\nunder Agent publication lock
    note over Handler, Service
      Project displayName, description, userCases.
      No model, refresh, Session write, or capacity lease.
      No complete cache: existing 422 error.
    end note
  else Other Builtins
    Handler -> Service : command-specific admission\nand locking
  end
  Service --> Handler : command-specific DTO
  Handler --> Application : command result
  Application --> Controller : immutable response VO
end
Controller --> Caller : ResultBean application/json
@enduml

@startuml command_authoritative_state
title Target-only Command Recovery Boundary
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@d84dd3d6 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/resources/db/gaussdb/install/session_schema.sql.
' Design reason: synchronous JSON results need no generic command lifecycle storage.
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "Name" as Name
rectangle "Model / Thinking / Compact" as Domain
database "Current Session state" as State
database "Existing domain Entries" as Entries
rectangle "GET Session / GET Events" as Query
Name --> State : displayName and version only
Domain --> State : atomic state changes
Domain --> Entries : append only when changed
Query --> State
Query --> Entries
note bottom
No commandId, command.started, command.completed, command.failed,
or session.name.changed sidecar.
end note
@enduml
